            "sid": "GEN 44:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami kambuŋeyi nadihana dehi kudi tata yami kwikala kapopu hamuloŋa wakansi, nami, neyi nakabula kukushikŋilayi muloŋa wakekala wamami kudeyi tata yami haya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu mwani, anleki ami kambuŋeyi nishali kunu nihiŋi mudi yena, nili nduŋu yambala yamwanta wami, wumuleki kansi ayi nawana kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
